" y=\"510\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Design lifestyle now</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"541\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Take mini-retirements</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"572\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Trade time for income</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"603\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Mobility over status</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"660\" width=\"940\" height=\"260\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">DEAL: Four Steps</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D — Definition: rewrite the rules and goals</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">E — Elimination: cut waste, time, distraction</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">A — Automation: build income that runs itself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\" text-anchor=\"middle\">L — Liberation: escape location and schedule</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"1010\" width=\"900\" height=\"70\" rx=\"35\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1055\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Lifestyle design is not a destination — it is a system</text></svg>",
